      "Neevu choodani sthalamedi Yesayyaa",
      "Kanumarugai nenundalenayyaa (2)",
      "Neevu vinani manavedi Yesayyaa",
      "Neevu theerchani baadha edi Yesayyaa (2)",
      "Neevunte naa venta adiye chaalayyaa (4) ||Neevu leni||"
